GETKBD,	LDA
	0
	STC QAEXIT+6	/SAVE RETURN
	ADD 1		/SAVE XRS 1 AND 2
	STC QAEXIT+3
	ADD 2
	STC QAEXIT+5
	STC QAEXIT+1
	KST	/WAS SOMETHING TYPED?
